56,"name":"Ashley Garner","role":"Patrick","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/r4VCFrVMXNZTlTNFlYP8qwGp0yq.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Prima dell'alba","overview":"Jim Collins, un giovane dell'entroterra australiano, si unisce ai soldati sul fronte occidentale con la speranza di fare la differenza, ma la realtà di una guerra fangosa, spietata e logorante mette a dura prova la sua determinazione.","tagline":"La guerra lascia cicatrici. Gli eroi lasciano leggende."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"After leaving his family's sheep farm in the Australian outback, a young man joins his countrymen on the western front of World War I with hopes of helping expedite an end to the bloody conflict. But as war rages on, he is forced to grapple with the brutal realities of trench warfare, including a near-constant battle to keep himself alive—without leaving another man behind.\r Inspired by the real-life diary entries of local ANZACs, the feature film details the untold story of some of Australia’s greatest military victories.","tagline":"War leaves scars. Heroes leave legends."}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qWn2ykNbjYRL00uB3DDSi1Bcu1I.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qWn2ykNbjYRL00uB3DDSi1Bcu1I.png","language":"en","width":2894,"height":1260}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pX0hiewh2WqelUutE9BwA0XcTmh.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pX0hiewh2WqelUutE9BwA0XcTmh.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1TYeFMNvdmgd0VGRbC1uK9MxYmQ.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1TYeFMNvdmgd0VGRbC1uK9MxYmQ.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/a51x5NWJqdzWbFA58dwRgwfgQDj.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/a5